# INVWINQD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: at level 1, a
# reader, CTRL-D on the item list is refused as CTRL-E is, each refusal
# in a message box closed by ENTER, and the Record menu's Duplicate is
# grayed in every snapshot.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINQD.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER
S AFTER1
K CTRL-D
S NOCOPY
K ENTER
S AFTER2
K ALT-C C
S MENUCOPY
K ALT-F X
